      "en": "As the mountains surround Jerusalem, so the LORD surrounds his people from this time forward and forever more.",
      "ko": "산들이 예루살렘을 두름과 같이 여호와께서 그 백성을 지금부터 영원까지 두르시리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "0cc0413c5fb1c1dbd49ac2a14e46e12f94ca035222da623801b1a368b96fc865",
      "translation_text_hash": "09b756f6cdfa4e6f38923eae3440fc065c23332d20f13eb4191e43c14e7b2621",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
