      "en": "Do good, LORD, to those who are good, to those who are upright in their hearts.",
      "ko": "여호와여 선인에게와 마음이 정직한 자에게 선을 행하소서",
      "source_text_hash": "307a172036f8138fcf2c5bc7244dc754fa297072a7519ff449a4d5c4c6262a39",
      "translation_text_hash": "2ca4ea026b47f71265155559ab1550cd30366b7889801804f8bc239f82164181",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와여 선인에게와 마음이 정직한 자에게 선을 행하소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2ca4ea026b47f71265155559ab1550cd30366b7889801804f8bc239f82164181"
